{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_139_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_139_ng_01_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "859fef9074d7ca4c5fd62a88b636ca5b5ee81686875c152fc42f3c0b7f75b3ab", "ja": "ひゃっ！　せ、先生！？\nって……すごっ！　なんスか、そのイケイケな格好！？", "zh": "呀！老、老师！？\n等等……好厉害！这身时髦的打扮是怎么回事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
